  "description": "鏈湴鎻掍欢绠＄悊鍣細鍒嗙被鎶樺彔銆佹洿鏂版簮涓€閿洿鏂帮紙npm/GitHub/鎻掍欢瓒呭競锛夈€佹祻瑙堝櫒涓嬭浇浼樺厛銆佷笅杞界洰褰曡嚜鍔ㄥ畨瑁呫€佹彃浠跺競鍦猴紙dshfind 绮鹃€夌洰褰曪級銆佹晳鐮栦笌鍚姩鍓嶈嚜妫€",
  "author": "nonentity303",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/nonentity303/dsh-plugin-manager.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/nonentity303/dsh-plugin-manager#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/nonentity303/dsh-plugin-manager/issues"
